Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:34:56 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Conditional 1976 Comparator: compare explicit-hypothesis
 forms

The first run failed on Goals.PsiTable1976: in the solution it refers to the
auxiliary literal proof PsiTable1975._proof_1 (shared in Targets.lean), in the
challenge to PsiTable1976._proof_1. A def such as Head1000.Certified has the
same problem in a one-file challenge. New theorems psi_error_of_zeros0to1000
and of_zeros0to1000 take located/unique/count as hypotheses (theorem types
inline those proofs); the challenge also defines PsiTable1975 first. The
failed run's record is kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ENyrFhoguS63Mdkksonvop
